{{c|Aberrancy of Curvature, the angle ''a h c''.}}
{{smaller|'''Aberrancy of curvature''', in ''math.'', the angle between the normal to a curve at any point and the line from that point to the middle point of the infinitesimal chord parallel to the tangent.}}
